      "message": "Redundant with EC_HOST_EVENT_PANIC:\n\nThe ISH could raise this host event, that will raise a EC_MKBP_EVENT_HOST_EVENT.",
      "revId": "621f9c7db5bc377df50afe84c0f373633690ef8d",
