        "id": 1104704
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-22T17:40:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Assuming CONFIG_HOSTCMD_X86 is not defined, host event are sent over MKBP, not over HECI directly. See `host_set_events()` in `common/host_event_commands.c`.",
      "parentUuid": "af31597c_f7c16abd",
      "revId": "621f9c7db5bc377df50afe84c0f373633690ef8d",
